OL,3,GNEWSAWater taxis halted as weeds choke
OL,4,Ariver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water taxi has suspended services
OL,7,Fbecause of the "frustrating" condition
OL,8,Fof a river, according to its manager.
OL,10,FThe Spalding Water Taxi and Boat Hire
OL,11,Fhas cancelled crossings of the River
OL,12,FWelland for a week after weeds blocked
OL,13,Fthe waterway.
OL,15,F"It's not just my frustration, it's for
OL,16,Fthe whole town and people who come and
OL,17,Fvisit," operations manager Anthony
OL,18,FGrunwell said. "I'm really letting them
OL,19,Fdown and I feel for them very much."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
