OL,3,GNEWSAWater taxis halted as weeds choke
OL,4,Ariver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Environment
OL,7,FAgency said: "We understand people's
OL,8,Flove of this river and are working with
OL,9,Four partners to remove the blockage and
OL,10,Fresolve the issue."
